<title>COTE D'IVOIRE: Ivory Coast lifts import controls on rubber trade.</title>
<headline>Ivory Coast lifts import controls on rubber trade.</headline>
<dateline>ABIDJAN 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ivory Coast has lifted import controls on all rubber goods, according to a government statement published in the official daily Fraternite-Matin.</p>
<p>All rubber goods, including used tyres for remoulding, are now removed from the restricted list.</p>
<p>-- Abidjan newsroom +225 21 90 90</p>
</text>
